\cf0 \cb1 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 - If you would like to have the email alert sent out as a group text to your league follow these steps (iOS required, not sure if Android has an equivalent)\
	- Open the \'93Shortcuts\'94 app on your iOS device\
	- Select the \'93Automation\'94 tab at the bottom\
	- Tap the + icon (in top right corner) to create a new Personal Automation\
	- Tap the \'93Email\'94 option\
		- Sender: email account used to create the google app password, same as \'93senderMail\'94 value in ShameBot.py\
		- Subject Contains: \'93ShameBot - League Name\'94 (where \'93League Name\'94 is your specific leagues\'92s name\
		- Account: select the account you set as the \'93receiverMail\'94 value in ShameBot.py, this is the account that should receive the email notification\
		- Recipient: leave as \'93Any Recipient\'94\
		- Tap the option for \'93Run Immediately\'94\
		- Tap Next\
	- Tap the \'93Create New Shortcut\'94 option\
		- Search for \'93get images\'94 and select the \'93Get Images from Input\'94 option\
			- Tap on \'93Input\'94 and select \'93Shortcut Input\'94\
			- Tap on \'93Shortcut Input\'94 and select \'93Attachments\'94, then slide the selection window down out of the way			\
		- Search for \'93get text\'94 and select the \'93Get Text from Input\'94 option\
			- Tap on \'93Images\'94 and select \'93Clear Variable\'94\
			- Tap on \'93Input\'94 and select \'93Shortcut Input\'94\
		- Search for \'93send message\'94 and select the \'93Send Message\'94 option\
			- Tap on \'93Text\'94 and select \'93Clear Variable\'94\
			- Tap on \'93Message\'94 and select both \'93Images\'94 and \'93Text\'94 variables\
			- Tap on \'93Recipients\'94 and enter the phone number of each person in the league\
		- Tap on the blue check in the top right corner to save the automation
