\f0\b0 \cf2 - Run ShameBot.py manually (Open in IDLE (python editor) and press F5)\
	- In the Shell output you will be prompted to authorize, navigate to the link provided in a web browser\
	- Login to Yahoo and copy the code provided\
	- In the IDLE shell enter y to confirm you have authorized\
	- In the IDLE shell enter the code provided by Yahoo\
	- If any roster limits have been exceeded you will see a message output and receive an email notification\
	- You can test functionality by setting the roster limits lower, ie set QB to 1, then you will get an email notification listing every team with 2 or more QBs on their roster\
